CompileTimeError: d84_a_decimal_literal_with_too_many_digits_needs_tilde.jern:2:23, line 2 column 23
 2 |     let $d: Decimal = 0.12345678901234567890123456789012345
   |                       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 fix:  `~0.12345678901234567890123456789012345`
 why:  a number literal its type can't hold exactly is written with `~`, and one it can is written without (D84, standard 2.1a)
